<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<TcPlcObject Version="1.1.0.1">
  <Itf Name="ISafetySwitch" Id="{b97c3403-2ee2-49e8-ba0c-1a4f3ce09363}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This interface needs to be implemented for a subscription to the ISafetyReleaseDistributer interface.
The provided methods switchOn and switchOff are automatically called if the safety release changes.

